# Build context for apps/api/Dockerfile is the backend repo root (pnpm workspace).
# Keep it small and free of secrets; the image installs and builds everything itself.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
.husky
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
infra
docs
apps/api/src/generated
apps/api/test
**/Dockerfile
**/.dockerignore
